  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/19834c919966288c99419a07884d09739eed61fb7b636905d29e78d8456bb0d3.png] \n\nGiven equation: **9 + 3 - 15 × 5 ÷ 8 = 2**\n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **+, -**\n\n→ 9 - 3 + 15 × **5 ÷ 8** = 2\n\n→ 9 - 3 + **15 × 5/8** = 2\n\n→ **9** - 3 **+ 9.3** = 2\n\n→ 18.3 - 3 = 2\n\n→ 15.3 ≠ 2</s",
